OL,3,AUgandan police investigate deaths of
OL,4,Afour pupils in suspected school
OL,5,Apoisoning
OL,6,
OL,7,FUgandan police are investigating the
OL,8,Fdeaths of four pupils at a school in
OL,9,Fthe capital Kampala which they suspect
OL,10,Fmay be the result of poisoning.
OL,12,FThe four girls, aged between nine and
OL,13,F11 years, died on Tuesday. Three of the
OL,14,Fpupils died at home while the fourth
OL,15,Fpassed away while receiving emergency
OL,16,Ftreatment at a hospital.
OL,18,FThe head teacher at the school,
OL,19,FTa'aliim Primary School and Quran
OL,20,FMemorisation Centre, has been arrested
OL,21,Fto assist with investigations.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
